---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Travel With Masala Chai"
  description="About Travel With Masala Chai and the stories behind the journeys."
>

  <section class="about-page">

    <div class="about-intro">

      <p class="eyebrow">
        ABOUT
      </p>

      <h1>
        Travel, stories and
        a little masala chai.
      </h1>

    </div>


    <div class="about-content">

      <div class="about-label">
        <span>THE JOURNAL</span>
      </div>

      <div class="about-text">

        <p class="lead">
          Travel With Masala Chai is a personal travel journal built around
          real experiences, photographs and practical travel information.
        </p>

        <p>
          The goal is simple: document the places we visit and share the
          details that actually help when planning a trip.
        </p>

        <p>
         Hey There! A little bit about me, we are Indian couple travelling with our daughter since she was 1 year old.
          I never knew I love exploring places until we left our home. Why masala chai? because why not??
          Indian who loves chai and travel know its way to add spice in the life.
          From destinations and itineraries to food, stays, transport and
          things we would do differently next time, this is where the journey
          gets documented.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="about-divider"></div>


    <div class="about-bottom">

      <div>
        <span class="small-heading">WHAT YOU'LL FIND HERE</span>
      </div>

      <div class="features">

        <div>
          <h2>Real journeys</h2>
          <p>
            Personal experiences from places we've actually visited.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>Practical details</h2>
          <p>
            Transport, stays, costs, itineraries and useful planning notes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2>Travel stories</h2>
          <p>
            The photographs, moments and little discoveries behind each trip.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

</BaseLayout>


<style>

  .about-page {

    max-width: 1180px;

    margin: 0 auto;

    padding:
      90px 6%
      120px;

  }


  /* TOP */

  .about-intro {

    max-width: 900px;

  }


  .eyebrow {

    margin: 0 0 25px;

    color: #24384b;

    font-size: 13px;

    font-weight: 700;

    letter-spacing: 4px;

  }


  h1 {

    max-width: 850px;

    margin: 0;

    color: #172536;

    font-family:
      Georgia,
      "Times New Roman",
      serif;

    font-size:
      clamp(
        48px,
        6vw,
        78px
      );

    line-height: 1.02;

    letter-spacing: -1.5px;

  }


  /* CONTENT */

  .about-content {

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns:
      180px
      minmax(0, 650px);

    gap: 60px;

    margin-top: 75px;

  }


  .about-label {

    padding-top: 8px;

  }


  .about-label span,
  .small-heading {

    font-size: 11px;

    font-weight: 700;

    letter-spacing: 2.5px;

    color: #7a7f82;

  }


  .about-text {

    font-size: 19px;

    line-height: 1.75;

    color: #53606c;

  }


  .about-text p {

    margin:
      0 0
      30px;

  }


  .about-text .lead {

    margin-bottom: 35px;

    color: #24384b;

    font-size: 24px;

    line-height: 1.55;

  }


  /* DIVIDER */

  .about-divider {

    height: 1px;

    margin:
      80px 0
      55px;

    background: #ddd9d1;

  }


  /* BOTTOM */

  .about-bottom {

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns:
      180px
      1fr;

    gap: 60px;

  }


  .features {

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns:
      repeat(3, 1fr);

    gap: 35px;

  }


  .features h2 {

    margin:
      0 0
      12px;

    color: #172536;

    font-family:
      Georgia,
      "Times New Roman",
      serif;

    font-size: 24px;

  }


  .features p {

    margin: 0;

    color: #69737b;

    font-size: 15px;

    line-height: 1.6;

  }


  /* MOBILE */

  @media (max-width: 750px) {

    .about-page {

      padding:
        70px 7%
        90px;

    }


    h1 {

      font-size: 48px;

    }


    .about-content,
    .about-bottom {

      grid-template-columns: 1fr;

      gap: 25px;

      margin-top: 55px;

    }


    .features {

      grid-template-columns: 1fr;

      gap: 35px;

    }

  }

</style>